Comment:
 mMassX continues the gyellen fork of mMass (https://github.com/gyellen/mMass),
 itself based on the original mMass v5.5.0 by Martin Strohalm
 (https://github.com/xxao/mMass). This is the same upstream lineage that was
 previously packaged for Debian as "mmass".

